ownloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/com.eli.mfgx/releases/download/224-0.2.24/MultiFingerGestureX-v0.2.24-20260704.apk", "size": 7802003, "downloadCount": 66}]}], "contributors": ["EliLei"], "readme": "# MultiFingerGestureX\n\nAn LSPosed/Xposed module that adds 3+ finger gesture support to Android 15+.\n为一加平板添加三指以上手势支持。傻逼OPPO连多指Home/Recents手势都没有。傻逼OPPO傻逼OPPO傻逼OPPO傻逼OPPO傻逼OPPO傻逼OPPO\n\n## What It Does\n\n<img width=\"480\" height=\"340\" alt=\"1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d1ceff6-58a7-4221-ab37-bb4ea93b5bad\" />\n\nPut three or more fingers on the screen:\n\n| Gesture | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| Short Tap | Back |\n| Swipe Down | Screenshot |\n| Swipe Up | Home (fast) / Recents (slow) |\n| Swipe Left / Right | Switch to previous / next app |\n\n三指或更多手指在屏幕上操作：\n\n| 手势 | 效果 |\n|------|------|\n| 短按 | 返回 |\n| 下滑 | 截屏 |\n| 上滑 | 快速 → 回桌面 / 慢速 → 最近任务 |\n| 左滑 / 右滑 | 切换上一个 / 下一个应用 |\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Android 15+ (API 35+)\n- LSPosed or compatible Xposed framework\n- Root access\n- Scope: **System Framework** (`android`)\n\n## License\n\nGNU General Public License v3.0\n"}